 "_comment": "Stations whose stop build_track_shapes.py placed off the platform: anchor [lng, lat] from OSM stop_position nodes of that line, kept only where it is nearer both the station's exits' centre and its KTDB point (2026-09-30). Applied by pipeline/stop_overrides.py. 2026-10-01: + every station whose stop sat ≥25 m from the middle of its line's OSM stop_position nodes (≥2 of them, ≤60 m apart), with the track slid over (shift). Checked against Kakao Map station by station; left out where OSM's stop positions sit ≥40 m off the platform (7호선 용마산, 9호선 노들·둔촌오륜·한성백제, 인천1호선 문학경기장·동춘). Entries marked \"from\": \"kakao\" take Kakao Map's station point (its search API, converted back to WGS84) where OSM is off (2026-10-01). \"osm-platform\": the middle of the line's OSM railway=platform areas, put on its OSM track (2026-10-05 trial: 1호선 영등포 · 신길, 5호선 신길 — replaces their Kakao-based points). \"kakao-lateral\": moved sideways only, onto Kakao Map's station line where the platform sat >15 m beside it (Kakao's station point is not the platform's middle along the line, so only the across-track offset is used).",
